\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =240%\\times 50 \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{5}\\times 50 \\\\  & =12\\times \\frac{50}{5} \\\\  & =12\\times 10 \\\\  & =120\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $240%$ of $50$ is $120.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186441682 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147483 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "20feb2c2-bcec-5730-be40-da2f8e44be59" :knowledge-point/title "Finding Part of a Number Given a Whole and a Percentage Greater Than 100%"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6c306237-c3de-526b-9961-c59eb34ac48d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "248" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441638}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6c306237-c3de-526b-9961-c59eb34ac48d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "248" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441638} :answer-field/id #uuid "97375675-8012-5fdd-8547-0626fe42d85b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441670}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "b63c78ef-ce78-5787-b3da-65a5a527693b" :question/math-academy-id "q-186053" :question/problem "$124%$ of $200$ is equal to{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "To solve this problem, we can use the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{part}=\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole}\n$$\n\nIn our case, the whole is $200,$ and the percentage is $124%.$ \n\n**Method 1**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a decimal:\n\n$$\n124%=124÷100=1.24\n$$\n\nApplying our formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =124%\\times 200 \\\\  & =1.24\\times 200 \\\\  & =248\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $124%$ of $200$ is $248.$\n\n**Method 2**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a fraction:\n\n$$\n124%=\\frac{124}{100}=\\frac{124÷4}{100÷4}=\\frac{31}{25}\n$$\n\nApplying our formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =124%\\times 200 \\\\  & =\\frac{31}{25}\\times 200 \\\\  & =31\\times \\frac{200}{25} \\\\  & =31\\times 8 \\\\  & =248\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $124%$ of $200$ is $248.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186441679 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147484 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "0025f8a6-40fc-544b-abc7-e9c283da8f33" :knowledge-point/title "Finding Part of a Number Given a Whole and a Decimal Percentage"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31e08bb2-2859-599b-82e3-db2faad45861" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441627}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "31e08bb2-2859-599b-82e3-db2faad45861" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0.15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441627} :answer-field/id #uuid "61534651-a815-57f0-8cf9-1b460e173330" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441665}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "760d2db7-2400-527c-8dd9-416b456caf4a" :question/math-academy-id "q-186071" :question/problem "$0.6%$ of $25$ is equal to{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "To solve this problem, we can use the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{part}=\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole}\n$$\n\nIn our case, the whole is $25,$ and the percentage is $0.6%.$ \n\n**Method 1**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a decimal:\n\n$$\n0.6%=0.6÷100=0.006\n$$\n\nApplying our formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =0.6%\\times 25 \\\\  & =0.006\\times 25 \\\\  & =0.15\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $0.6%$ of $25$ is $0.15.$ \n\n**Method 2**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a fraction:\n\n$$\n0.6%=\\frac{0.6}{100}=\\frac{0.6\\times 10}{100\\times 10}=\\frac{6}{1,000}\n$$\n\nApplying our formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =0.6%\\times 25 \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{1,000}\\times 25 \\\\  & =\\frac{150}{1,000} \\\\  & =0.15\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $0.6%$ of $25$ is $0.15.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186441677 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147482 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a0e1c05a-7c23-59f5-a549-ec9a8d0415e6" :knowledge-point/title "Finding Part of a Number Given a Whole and a Percentage"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "11421dbe-1fb6-5598-a5a3-7680bd0658a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "100" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441624} {:answer/id #uuid "3c1f2219-22b2-54a4-bed8-e31898300102" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "90" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441630} {:answer/id #uuid "5fb0d6c4-1371-5cca-860b-1f75bfbf1dd8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "95" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441633} {:answer/id #uuid "c79775ee-53c7-5b33-a175-3da2f6cd1630" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "110" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441646} {:answer/id #uuid "e7ec2e86-d0cb-5742-9317-e2c8f37c781d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "99" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441653}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3c1f2219-22b2-54a4-bed8-e31898300102" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "90" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441630} :answer-field/id #uuid "9297761d-52d2-55ad-bbf4-4aa8059fd778" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186441669}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "57978705-e111-53de-8645-669c0f65f078" :question/math-academy-id "q-61521" :question/problem "What is $9%$ of $1,000?$" :question/worked-solution "To solve this problem, we can use the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{part}=\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole}\n$$\n\nIn our case, the whole is $1,000$, and the percentage is $9%.$ \n\n**Method 1**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a decimal:\n\n$$\n9%=9÷100=0.09\n$$\n\nApplying our formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =9%\\times 1,000 \\\\  & =0.09\\times 1,000 \\\\  & =90\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $9%$ of $1,000$ is $90.$\n\n**Method 2**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a fraction:\n\n$$\n9%=\\frac{9}{100}\n$$\n\nApplying our formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =9%\\times 1,000 \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{100}\\times 1,000 \\\\  & =9\\times \\frac{1,000}{100} \\\\  & =9\\times 10 \\\\  & =90\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $9%$ of $1,000$ is $90.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147890 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147483 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "20feb2c2-bcec-5730-be40-da2f8e44be59" :knowledge-point/title "Finding Part of a Number Given a Whole and a Percentage Greater Than 100%"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "afbac020-f132-5e21-a592-ba884a925e15" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "32" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186145095} {:answer/id #uuid "d95d4dde-2d2e-55f4-a211-e1e0ec70664b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "35" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186145096} {:answer/id #uuid "de66